/E (In the modern era of automation, the Internet of Things \(IoT\) and embedded systems have revolutionized how we interact with our living spaces. Smart homes are no longer a futuristic concept but a present reality, requiring robust, scalable, and intuitive software solutions to manage an ecosystem of heterogeneous devices.)
